The radio data reduction was performed with PRESTO2(Ransom et al., 2002). Data were first cleaned of the most prominent radio frequency interference using rfifind, corrected for the observed dispersion measure of 706.5(3) pc cm{}^{-3}, and corrected to the Solar System barycenter using prepdata.

